{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://salsa.debian.org/debian/at",
    "description": [
      "排队、检查或删除稍后执行的作业。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--cat",
      "alias": [
        "-c"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-c"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "将命令行中列出的作业输出到标准输出。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--file",
      "alias": [
        "-f"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-f file"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "从文件而不是标准输入读取作业。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--format",
      "alias": [
        "-o"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-o fmt"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "设置作业列表的 strftime 风格格式。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--list",
      "alias": [
        "-l"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-l"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "列出待处理作业（atq 的别名）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--queue",
      "alias": [
        "-q"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-q queue"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "使用指定队列（a-z 或 A-Z）。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--remove",
      "alias": [
        "-r"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-r"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "移除作业（atrm 的别名）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--time",
      "alias": [
        "-t"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-t time"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "在指定时间运行作业（[[CC]YY]MMDDhhmm[.ss]）。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--user",
      "alias": [
        "-u"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-u username"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "将邮件发送给此用户而不是当前用户。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--verbose",
      "alias": [
        "-v"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-v"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "读取作业前显示执行时间。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "alias": [
        "-V"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-V, --version"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印版本号并退出。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-b",
      "tip": [
        "batch 的别名。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-d",
      "tip": [
        "atrm 的别名。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-m",
      "tip": [
        "作业完成时发送邮件，即使没有输出。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-M",
      "tip": [
        "从不向用户发送邮件。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
